slixmpp-go
============

This is an independent Go implementation of XMPP concepts and public APIs
inspired by:

* Slixmpp, Copyright its contributors, MIT License.
* slixmpp-omemo, Copyright its contributors, AGPL-3.0 License.
* python-omemo, Copyright its contributors, MIT License.

No Python source code is embedded. Protocol behavior is implemented from the
public XMPP RFCs/XEPs and documented public interfaces. Protocol names and XML
namespaces are interoperability identifiers.

